  "plot": "With indecipherable, spine-chilling visions about vampires haunting his sleep, unpopular Tony, a lonely 9-year-old American boy living in Scotland, finds it impossible to make new friends at school. But they say be careful what you wish for. When Tony catches the eye of the mysterious Rudolph, he is about to discover that the blood-sucking creatures exist. As the two boys share a strange connection, something unexpected happens: Tony finds meaning in his dreams and embarks on a dangerous quest to help Rudolph retrieve a magic amulet of power. With the fate of the vampire clan hanging by a thread, can the little vampire protect his only friend?",
